      <div class="prose prose-lg text-text-muted leading-relaxed">
        <p class="text-xl text-dark font-serif mb-6">We're a team of product enthusiasts, home designers, and lifestyle experts dedicated to cutting through marketing hype.</p>
        <p class="mb-6">Every product we review goes through rigorous real-world testing. We don't accept payment for positive reviews, and we never let sponsors influence our ratings. Our methodology is transparent, our data is public, and our verdicts are honest.</p>
        <p class="mb-6">Founded in 2026, 10Best Living was born from frustration with review sites that seemed more interested in affiliate commissions than honest assessment. We wanted to build something different — a place where data drives decisions and readers can trust what they read.</p>
        <p>Today, our team of 12 reviewers has tested over 500 products across 15 categories. Every review includes detailed specifications, comparison tables, and clear pros/cons so you can make informed decisions.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-16 grid grid-cols-3 gap-8 text-center">
        <div><div class="font-serif text-4xl font-bold text-gold mb-2">500+</div><div class="text-muted text-sm">Products Tested</div></div>
